0021:     - The output width matches the input width.
0022: 
0023:     Rule:
0024:     - Create an output whose height holds four overlapping copies of the input.
0025:     - Flip the input vertically for every other copy.
0026:     - Paste original, flipped, original, and flipped patterns with one-row overlaps.
0027: 
0028:     Key insight:
0029:     - Alternating vertical flips continues the wave smoothly because each copy starts
0030:       before the previous one fully ends.
0031:     """
0032:     # Plan:
